    "Current [A,new,new,New,é,e-combining-accent,punct!,tab-bearing-string] has8 occurrences; six distinct CURRENT words are absent from prior [old,A,old]. Case, punctuation, Unicode normalization and tab semantics are unchanged.",
    "One occupied gray bin has p=1,H=0. Two equally occupied bins have H=1. Four equally occupied bins have H=2. All integer histogram zeros use Shannon's limiting contribution0; a zero-total histogram is not assigned H=0.",
    "The repeated supplied CSV row contributes another current capture occurrence; no row/source-ID deduplication or grouping is performed."
  ],
